## Task: fix `RelatedFieldListFilter` / `RelatedOnlyFieldListFilter` ordering fallback

**Cause** — in `django/contrib/admin/filters.py`, `RelatedFieldListFilter.field_choices()` started with `ordering = ()` and only overrode it when the related model had its own registered `ModelAdmin` (`related_admin.get_ordering(request)`). With no related ModelAdmin, `ordering` stayed an empty tuple and was passed to `field.get_choices(ordering=...)`, which does `.order_by(*ordering)` — so the related model's `Meta.ordering` was silently ignored. `RelatedOnlyFieldListFilter` overrode `field_choices()` entirely and never passed `ordering` at all, so it had the same gap.

